A couple more ways:

1) What you need: Wand/spellbook of cold, ring of poly control, wand/ring of
   polymorph -- zap ice bolt to freeze water, walk up to wall, polymorph into
   Xorn or Earth Elemental, and through the wall you go!
2) What you need: A pick axe/wand or spellbook of digging, jumping boots --
   Go *AROUND* the moat (at the top of the screen only) by digging through the
   squares just above the moat, to reach the rear of the castle. To get over
   the pits, (s)earch for them and #jump over them with your boots.

